    "/services": {
      "get": {
        "description": "getServices, pms-api-v3.json \u2014 get one registered service, or all\nof them. Also the read path that actually enforces supervision (see\n_sweep_stale_service): a stale match is deregistered on its way out\nrather than ever being returned as still-registered.",
